    {
      "bbox": [
        374,
        1394,
        1868,
        1622
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "A Manual of Procedures: Executive and Staff Services was issued to your agency during September 1970. An additional step is planned to improve the manual to increase its usefulness to you and your staff officers, through the inclusion of organization charts.",
