        2118,
        1870,
        2412
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "The organization chart is one of the best devices for portraying line and staff distinctions. It is used in every large organization to provide information about the manifold phases of the work and to illustrate who has the authority and the responsibility for the actual performance of the various functions of the agency.",
